{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","roleHeading":"Initializer","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV09directoryC2Dn7groupIDACSS_SStcfc","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"directoryGroupDn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"directoryGroupDn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"groupID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management).","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)":{"title":"init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping\/init(directoryGroupDn:groupID:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping\/init(directorygroupdn:groupid:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"directoryGroupDn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"groupID","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"abstract":[{"text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The table is the only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"who names a group ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"admins"},{"text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"axiam_directory::dn"},{"text":"), so ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cn=staff,ou=groups"},{"text":" are the same row.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redundant.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GroupMapping","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GroupMapping","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"}}}